== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: tileloaddrs [ENC: EVEX, MAP: 0F38, OPC: 0x4A]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AMX_TILE
    ISA-SET: APX_F_AMX_MOVRS
    ISA-EXT: APXEVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: AMXE3_EVEX
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_SIB HAS_EVEX ACCEPTS_SEGMENT HAS_EEVEX 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 F2 7F 08 4A 04 17 

