== [      APX ] ============================================================================================
  USES_EGPR: N
     HAS_NF: N
     HAS_ZU: N
        SCC: NONE

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: tileloaddrs (%rdi,%rdx,1), %tmm0
   RELATIVE: tileloaddrs (%rdi,%rdx,1), %tmm0

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: tileloaddrs tmm0, ds:[rdi+rdx*1]
   RELATIVE: tileloaddrs tmm0, ds:[rdi+rdx*1]

